  "policyIntroTitle": "Introduction",
  "policyIntroContent": "EcoWallet is committed to protecting your privacy. This policy explains how we collect, use, and safeguard your personal information.",
  "policyDataCollectionTitle": "Data Collection",
  "policyDataCollectionContent": "We collect information you provide directly, such as your name, email, and financial transaction data. All data is stored securely on your device and optionally in encrypted cloud storage.",
  "policyDataUsageTitle": "How We Use Your Data",
  "policyDataUsageContent": "Your data is used solely to provide app functionality, including transaction tracking, budget management, and generating financial reports. We never sell your data to third parties.",
  "policySecurityTitle": "Data Security",
  "policySecurityContent": "We implement industry-standard security measures including encryption, secure data transmission, and regular security audits to protect your information.",
  "policyRightsTitle": "Your Rights",
  "policyRightsContent": "You have the right to access, modify, export, or delete your data at any time through the app settings. You can also request a complete data deletion by contacting our support team.",
