  "termsServiceContent": "EcoWallet provides personal finance management tools including transaction tracking, budgeting, and financial analytics. The service is provided 'as is' for personal, non-commercial use.",
  "termsAccountTitle": "User Accounts",
  "termsAccountContent": "You are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of your account credentials and for all activities under your account. You must provide accurate and complete information when creating an account.",
  "termsContentTitle": "User Content",
  "termsContentContent": "You retain all rights to the financial data you enter into the app. By using our cloud backup features, you grant us permission to store and process this data solely for providing the service.",
